generated_hash =

// @vibe/compiler/entry/source_compile/rewrite — the AST rewrites the linear
// driver (wasi_only) and the wasm-gc driver (gc_only) both run on a parsed
// program before codegen: string-interpolation expansion and the erasure of
// generic binders. Directory-shared-scope package.
//
// It is a leaf on purpose. gc_only cannot import wasi_only (that path makes
// the root compiler package see wasi_only twice and reports a dependency
// cycle), so before this package existed gc_only carried hand-synced copies
// of both rewrites.

// --- interp.vibe
fn expand_interp_only(stmts: Array[Stmt]) -> Unit with Exception

// --- strip_generics.vibe
fn strip_generic_type_params(stmts: Array[Stmt]) -> Unit
